 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・品種: 夏の暑さで花が途切れたら切り戻して若返らせる（暑さによる夏の切り戻し）。RHS: 花後の茎と古葉を取る。おぎはら楽天: 花が減ったら1/3に切る。stauden.de: 秋に茎を切る",
  "management_type_quote": "If bloom interrupts in the heat of the summer, plants can be cut back to rejuvenate",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；中\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐湿性: 普 通 ある程度耐えますが 高温多湿は嫌います（蒸れ 中 相当）\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向〜明るい日陰／暖地: 昼過ぎから半日陰が理想（西日 △ 相当）\n[MBG/品種] Plants prefer some part afternoon shade in the St.\n[MBG/品種] In hot summer climates, the primary bloom runs from late spring to early summer (June - July) with a lighter bloom continuing throughout summer into fall.\n[MBG/品種] If bloom interrupts in the heat of the summer, plants can be cut back to rejuvenate, shape and/or encourage a late summer/early fall rebloom.\n[MBG/品種] It will tolerate summer heat but will do better in part shade in hot climates.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
